# Blurred Bottom Bar — floating BlurView pill tab bar (Home/Explore/Camera/Settings)
# over full-screen photo tabs with freezeOnBlur; active icon fades to full opacity.
# What this test covers: each tab forwards and backwards, re-tapping the focused
# tab (the pop-to-top branch of onTapIcon), long jumps, and rapid tapping
# across tabs so the opacity timings are retargeted and frozen screens are
# thawed in quick succession. Icons are unlabeled: tapped by position
# (x 107/170/232/295, y 795).
context platform=ios
open "demos://animations/blurred-bottom-bar"
wait "label=\"Close\"" 10000
wait 1000
press 170 795
wait 700
press 232 795
wait 700
press 295 795
wait 700
press 232 795
wait 700
press 170 795
wait 700
press 107 795
wait 700
# Re-tap the focused tab.
press 107 795 --count 3
wait 700
# Long jumps.
press 295 795
wait 700
press 107 795
wait 700
# Rapid switching.
press 295 795
wait 60
press 170 795
wait 60
press 232 795
wait 60
press 107 795
wait 60
press 295 795
wait 60
press 170 795
wait 1200
wait "label=\"Close\"" 3000
press "role=\"button\" label=\"Close\" id=\"xmark\""
wait 1500
